        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are progressing toward GMP for the Northern Pipeline during the second quarter of 2026 prior to the start of construction activities and expect a GMP after we move through design and pre-construction services for the Southern Pipeline during second half of 2026.",
