        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Since the 1980s, we have developed the land for our agricultural use and we either farm the property directly or via leases to private farming operators.",
        "start_character": 9774,
        "end_character": 9927
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010517-d1bd5acf7eba3959",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To deliver conserved water off-property or import water for storage at the Cadiz Ranch, we are currently developing two pipeline routes for the Mojave Groundwater Bank – (1) the Southern Pipeline , which would extend southwards from the Cadiz Ranch to the Colorado River Aqueduct in Rice, California, and (2) the Northern Pipeline, which extends northwards from the Cadiz Ranch to Barstow, Antelope Valley, and Wheeler Ridge, California.",
        "start_character": 18924,
        "end_character": 19361
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010517-d1bd5acf7eba3959",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Under our water supply agreements, it is anticipated that we will contribute our annual supply of 50,000 AFY of water into Fenner Gap Mutual Water Company (\"FGMWC\"), a mutual water company that we presently manage that will ultimately be jointly owned by all participating public water agencies that have acquired water supply from the Mojave Groundwater Bank.",
        "start_character": 14137,
        "end_character": 14497
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010517-d1bd5acf7eba3959",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We appreciate the importance of retention, growth and development of our employees.",
        "start_character": 45744,
        "end_character": 45827
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010517-d1bd5acf7eba3959",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a water solutions provider with a unique combination of land, water, pipeline and water filtration assets located in Southern California between major water systems serving population centers in the Southwestern United States.",
        "start_character": 35,
        "end_character": 268
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010517-d1bd5acf7eba3959",
